:Effet_Meteo rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf :Effet_Terrain .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon#Effet_Multicoup
:Effet_Multicoup rdf:type owl:Class ;
