<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Caracteristique_capacite> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Condition_evolution
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Condition_evolution> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Degat_subis
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Degat_subis> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Condition_evolution> .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Echange_avec_pokemon_specifique
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Echange_avec_pokemon_specifique> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Condition_evolution> .


